<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Unicer considers buyback.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Unicer considers buyback.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese drinks firm Unicer-Uniao Cervejeira said that it would propose to shareholders a buyback of up to 10 percent of the company stock.</p>
<p>The proposal would be put to a shareholder assembly set for April 8 to approve the company's 1996 results, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
